[from ClickUp — @Gurdeep Singh, 2026-02-19]

@Brenda Walters Just to clarify, this script was originally implemented to prevent customers from being charged double or triple shipping fees, particularly in cases where items were fulfilled from multiple locations.
If we are confident that the Zyber custom shipping app can now handle this scenario correctly without duplicating charges, then we can safely remove the script. In any case, we will need to identify a long term solution, as the Script Editor app will be deprecated by 30 June 2026.

